<span id="A1.T1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">DeepSeek-Coder-V2-Lite-Instruct (16B)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding:1pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
