</section>
<section id="A1.SS10" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.10 </span>ROTE Implementation Details</h3>

<div id="A1.SS10.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We will fully open-source our code, including the prompts we used for generating programs with ROTE across the various levels of structure. In Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.10 ROTE Implementation Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Modeling Others’ Minds as Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, we show the full algorithm for ROTE and subsequently discuss the implementation details.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.SS10.fig1" class="ltx_figure">
<div id="A1.SS10.fig1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:377.6pt;height:298.4pt;vertical-align:-292.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-33.1pt,26.2pt) scale(0.850658564716864,0.850658564716864) ;">
<div id="A1.SS10.fig1.1.1" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:437.2pt;">
            
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> ROTE (Representing Others’ Trajectories as Executables)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
                    
                    
                  Observed history <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="h_{0:t-1}=\{(o_{0},a_{0}),\dots,(o_{t-1},a_{t-1})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{0:t-1}=\{(o_{0},a_{0}),\dots,(o_{t-1},a_{t-1})\}</annotation></semantics></math>, current observation <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, Environment <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math>, Initial set of candidate programs <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}</annotation></semantics></math> (can be empty), Initial set of program priors <math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{priors}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>priors</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{priors}}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
                    
                    
                  Predicted action <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{a_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{a_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math>, Predicted programs <math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}</annotation></semantics></math>, Predicted program posterior <math id="alg1.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{posteriors}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>posteriors</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{posteriors}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
                    
                    
                  <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span> <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PredictAction</span>(<math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="h_{0:t-1},o_{t},\mathcal{E},k,\Lambda_{\text{candidates}},P_{\text{priors}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>priors</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{0:t-1},o_{t},\mathcal{E},k,\Lambda_{\text{candidates}},P_{\text{priors}}</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
                    
                    
                    <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-|\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-|\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}|</annotation></semantics></math> generations <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span> <span id="alg1.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Number of programs to sample
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
                    
                    
                     Prompt LLM with <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="h_{0:t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{0:t-1}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math>, and synthesize an FSM-like Python program <math id="alg1.l5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
                    
                    
                     <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}\leftarrow\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}\cup\{\lambda\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}\leftarrow\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}\cup\{\lambda\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
                    
                    
                     <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p_{\text{prior}}(\lambda)\leftarrow\Pi_{n=1}^{|\lambda|}p_{\text{LLM}}(\text{token}_{n}|h_{0:t-1},o_{t},\mathcal{E},\text{token}_{n-1},\cdots,\text{token}_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>LLM</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mtext>token</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mtext>token</mtext><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mtext>token</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\text{prior}}(\lambda)\leftarrow\Pi_{n=1}^{|\lambda|}p_{\text{LLM}}(\text{token}_{n}|h_{0:t-1},o_{t},\mathcal{E},\text{token}_{n-1},\cdots,\text{token}_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
                    
                    
                     <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{priors}}\leftarrow P_{\text{priors}}\cup\{p_{\text{prior}}(\lambda)\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>priors</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>priors</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{priors}}\leftarrow P_{\text{priors}}\cup\{p_{\text{prior}}(\lambda)\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
                    
                    
                    <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
                    
                    
                    <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{priors}}\leftarrow\operatorname{normalize}(P_{\text{priors}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>priors</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>normalize</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>priors</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{priors}}\leftarrow\operatorname{normalize}(P_{\text{priors}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Renormalize priors to account for new hypotheses
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
                    
                    
                    <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{posteriors}}=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>posteriors</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{posteriors}}=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
                    
                    
                    <span id="alg1.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\in\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\in\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
                    
                    
                     <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\lambda)\propto\Pi_{o_{i},a_{i}\in h_{0:t-1}}p(a_{i}|o_{i},\lambda)\cdot p_{\text{prior}}(\lambda)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>h</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\lambda)\propto\Pi_{o_{i},a_{i}\in h_{0:t-1}}p(a_{i}|o_{i},\lambda)\cdot p_{\text{prior}}(\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Calculate likelihood <math id="alg1.l13.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(\mathcal{H}_{[0,t-1]}|\lambda)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\mathcal{H}_{[0,t-1]}|\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
                    
                    
                     <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{posteriors}}\leftarrow P_{\text{posteriors}}\cup\{p(\lambda)\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>posteriors</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>posteriors</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{posteriors}}\leftarrow P_{\text{posteriors}}\cup\{p(\lambda)\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
                    
                    
                    <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
                    
                    
                    <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{posteriors}}\leftarrow\operatorname{normalize}(\operatorname{top-k}(P_{\text{posteriors}},k))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>posteriors</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>normalize</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>top</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>posteriors</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{posteriors}}\leftarrow\operatorname{normalize}(\operatorname{top-k}(P_{\text{posteriors}},k))</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l16.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Subsample and Renormalize
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
                    
                    
                    Predicted action <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{a_{t}}\leftarrow\operatorname{argmax}_{a\in\mathcal{A}}\sum_{\lambda\in\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}}p_{\text{posteriors}}(\lambda)\cdot\lambda(a|o_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>argmax</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mmultiscripts><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi></mrow><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>posteriors</mtext></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{a_{t}}\leftarrow\operatorname{argmax}_{a\in\mathcal{A}}\sum_{\lambda\in\Lambda_{\text{candidates}}}p_{\text{posteriors}}(\lambda)\cdot\lambda(a|o_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{a_{t}},\Lambda_{\text{candidates}},P_{\text{posteriors}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>posteriors</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{a_{t}},\Lambda_{\text{candidates}},P_{\text{posteriors}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
                    
                    
                  <span id="alg1.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
          
</div>
</span></div>
</figure>
<section id="A1.SS10.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.10.1 </span>ROTE Hyperparameters for Construction and Partnr</h4>

<div id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Across the prediction tasks for ground-truth scripted agents and humans in <span id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Construction</span>, and LLM agents in <span id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Partnr</span>, we used the same set of hyperparameters, indicating the generality of our method with minimal environment-specific finetuning. The only hyperparameter which varied across environments was the use of two-stage observation parsing. We used two-stage observation parsing for predicting scripted agent behavior in <span id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Construction</span> and LLM-agent behavior in <span id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Partnr</span>. We did not use it for predicting human behavior. As mentioned in Section <a href="#A1.SS7" title="A.7 Per-llm Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Modeling Others’ Minds as Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.7</span></a>, all hyperparameters were fit by comparing their performance on 20<math id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>%</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\%</annotation></semantics></math> of the data, then utilizing the best performing hyperparameter from that subset, as the selected model configuration for the remaining 80<math id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>%</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\%</annotation></semantics></math> of the data.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
