<span id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p2.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">How strictly we constrain generated programs to adhere to FSM structure</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS10.SSS1.p2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Light</td></tr>
