<section id="A1.SS10.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.10.3 </span>Examples of High Level Trajectory Summaries Generated by ROTE</h4>

<div id="A1.SS10.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS10.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Listings <a href="#LST3" title="Listing 3 ‣ A.10.3 Examples of High Level Trajectory Summaries Generated by ROTE ‣ A.10 ROTE Implementation Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Modeling Others’ Minds as Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#LST4" title="Listing 4 ‣ A.10.3 Examples of High Level Trajectory Summaries Generated by ROTE ‣ A.10 ROTE Implementation Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Modeling Others’ Minds as Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, we show sample high-level trajectory summarizations from the optional two-stage observation parsing step. While in <a href="#LST3" title="Listing 3 ‣ A.10.3 Examples of High Level Trajectory Summaries Generated by ROTE ‣ A.10 ROTE Implementation Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Modeling Others’ Minds as Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> the model attributes the movements of the ground truth patrolling agent as “exploring randomly,” it still is able to capture some aspects of its movement, such as not interacting with blocks. In <a href="#LST4" title="Listing 4 ‣ A.10.3 Examples of High Level Trajectory Summaries Generated by ROTE ‣ A.10 ROTE Implementation Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Modeling Others’ Minds as Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, ROTE can better summarize the behavior of agents in <span id="A1.SS10.SSS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Partnr</span>, but without a clear guess as to which objects the agent is trying to rearrange, it can be difficult to make a program which concisely narrows down the hypothesis space.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST3" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="LST3.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="Prompts/high_level_description_grid.txt">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx144" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
                
                
                
              
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx145" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2</span>
                
                
                
              <span id="lstnumberx145.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1.</span><span id="lstnumberx145.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">The</span><span id="lstnumberx145.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">agent</span><span id="lstnumberx145.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">’</span><span id="lstnumberx145.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">s</span><span id="lstnumberx145.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">overall</span><span id="lstnumberx145.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">goal</span><span id="lstnumberx145.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">or</span><span id="lstnumberx145.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">strategy</span><span id="lstnumberx145.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span><span id="lstnumberx145.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">The</span><span id="lstnumberx145.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">agent</span><span id="lstnumberx145.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">appears</span><span id="lstnumberx145.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">to</span><span id="lstnumberx145.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">be</span><span id="lstnumberx145.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">exploring</span><span id="lstnumberx145.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">its</span><span id="lstnumberx145.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">environment</span><span id="lstnumberx145.34" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">,</span><span id="lstnumberx145.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">possibly</span><span id="lstnumberx145.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">looking</span><span id="lstnumberx145.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">for</span><span id="lstnumberx145.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx145.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">specific</span><span id="lstnumberx145.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">block</span><span id="lstnumberx145.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">or</span><span id="lstnumberx145.49" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx145.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">blocks</span><span id="lstnumberx145.51" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx146" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3</span>
                
                
                
              <span id="lstnumberx146.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">   </span><span id="lstnumberx146.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">It</span><span id="lstnumberx146.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">is</span><span id="lstnumberx146.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">not</span><span id="lstnumberx146.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">actively</span><span id="lstnumberx146.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">engaging</span><span id="lstnumberx146.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">with</span><span id="lstnumberx146.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx146.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">environment</span><span id="lstnumberx146.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">in</span><span id="lstnumberx146.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx146.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx146.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewrite